{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "I can't believe it! I've never been this close to the ring!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "To be honest, it looks sick. What are we doing here, though?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "We have to study it, Zack! Find out what it was used for.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "People already studied it, didn't they? Don't you have a book about it right here with you ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "As a matter of fact, I do. Sadly, it's incomplete. I feel like the one who wrote the book did not have any knowledge of old world technologies.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "That's a bit lame for a book about Old World Archeology.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "It's understandable. Occidens researchers only managed to repair a computer recently after years and years of trial and error.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "Is that what we're looking for then? A computer?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "",
            "text": "That's right. If we can turn it on, we can learn a lot about the ring.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
